Road Track — provenance and licence
https://github.com/spencernorton/roadtrack

Origin
------
Original work, not a fork. Road Track is a layer of browser-side files over
LubeLogger by Hargata Softworks (https://github.com/hargata/lubelog). Its
container image is built FROM LubeLogger's published image
(ghcr.io/hargata/lubelogger); it appends a stylesheet and a script to two of
LubeLogger's static files, replaces its icons and web app manifest, and adds
its own files under /brand/. It changes none of LubeLogger's server code.
Road Track is not affiliated with or endorsed by Hargata Softworks.

LubeLogger's credit and its funding link stay in the app's About panel.

Artwork
-------
The Road Track icon and logo (brand/icon.svg, brand/icon-maskable.svg,
brand/logo.svg and the rasters generated from them) were drawn for this
project and are licensed with the rest of the repository.

The screenshots in docs/assets/ were captured from a Road Track instance
holding only the synthetic records that tools/preview.py generates, and are
licensed with the rest of the repository.

Data
----
The per-model depreciation curves in brand/metrics/aggregate.js are residual
percentages read from CarEdge's published per-model depreciation tables. They
are estimates for charting, not appraisals.

